00:26:18.100 --> 00:26:22.820
Here I'm importing easing
from vanilla react-native.

00:26:22.820 --> 00:26:26.460
But I need to import
the one from Reanimated.

00:26:26.460 --> 00:26:27.480
So that should be good.

00:26:27.480 --> 00:26:31.110
This is where [INAUDIBLE]
[? script ?] is so useful.

00:26:31.110 --> 00:26:34.930
So here we execute the timing
function for every frame.

00:26:34.930 --> 00:26:37.170
And what we want to
return is the position.

00:26:37.170 --> 00:26:40.740
So state.position.

00:26:40.740 --> 00:26:43.970
So we see it animates
nicely from 0 to 1.

00:26:43.970 --> 00:26:47.180
At 1, nothing happens.

00:26:47.180 --> 00:26:49.260
So at 1, what we need to do--

00:26:49.260 --> 00:26:54.830
so if state.finish equals 1--

00:26:54.830 --> 00:26:56.830
so you see here, we are
not [? write-- ?] again,

00:26:56.830 --> 00:27:01.600
we are not writing if else,
because this is not just code

00:27:01.600 --> 00:27:04.000
that is executed imperatively.

00:27:04.000 --> 00:27:05.800
This is a declaration.

00:27:05.800 --> 00:27:10.390
So we use a condition
animation node.

00:27:10.390 --> 00:27:15.410
That is a declaration
to run on the UI Thread.

00:27:15.410 --> 00:27:19.640
So if the state of the
animation is finished,

00:27:19.640 --> 00:27:22.910
we want to reset these
animation values.

00:27:22.910 --> 00:27:24.290
Position we will leave.

00:27:24.290 --> 00:27:27.450
But we need to update
the [? toValue. ?]

00:27:27.450 --> 00:27:29.660
So let me reset the state.

00:27:29.660 --> 00:27:31.460
So is finished is 0.

00:27:31.460 --> 00:27:33.740
We want to loop.

00:27:33.740 --> 00:27:36.090
FrameTime time we reset as well.

00:27:36.090 --> 00:27:37.760
Because we are
restarting the animation.

00:27:41.370 --> 00:27:42.390
Position we keep.

00:27:42.390 --> 00:27:43.980
If it's 1, it's still 1.

00:27:43.980 --> 00:27:46.530
We want to continue
where we were.

00:27:46.530 --> 00:27:49.710
So state.time.

00:27:49.710 --> 00:27:52.830
But what we want to change
is the destination value.

00:27:52.830 --> 00:27:59.040
So config toValue is going to be
the opposite of state.position.

00:27:59.040 --> 00:28:02.010
If position is 0, the
[? toValue ?] is 1.

00:28:02.010 --> 00:28:05.920
If position is 1, the
